cff-version: 1.2.0
type: dataset
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Global Spirits Inventory"
abstract: >-
  An openly licensed reference dataset of spirits by type and country, compiled
  from producer and retailer sources on the public web. Every row carries the
  sources that substantiate it and the date they were last checked.
